{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","墓所守卫"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Restless Guardian"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始以及主动使用时，制造一个护盾来代替友军承担部分伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","At the start of the battle or when actively used, Callan gains a shield that absorbs damage for allies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，拥有200% HP护盾，并处于霸体状态，但不可行动，护盾每秒衰减20%，护盾存在期间，会代替自身周围2格范围内的友军承担50%受到的物理和魔法伤害，护盾消失后，自身进入战斗。主动使用时，持续施法至多10秒，期间自身获得100% + 5% HP护盾，并处于霸体状态，代替自身周围2格范围内的友军承担50%受到的物理和魔法伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Callan gains a 200% HP shield and becomes unaffected. While the shield is active, Callan cannot move or act. The shield's value drops by 20% per second and can absorb 50% physical and magic damage taken by allies within a 2-tile radius. Callan enters the battle when the shield expires.\nActive. Callan maintains the shield for up to 10s, gaining a 100% + 5% HP shield and becomes unaffected. During this time, the shield absorbs 50% physical or magic damage taken by allies within a 2-tile radius."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":119,"end":124,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":374,"end":379,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":21,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":115,"end":127,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":133,"end":135,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":37,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":64,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":370,"end":382,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":402,"end":412,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，获得的护盾值提升至110% + 5% HP。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","When actively used, increases the shield value to 110% + 5% HP."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，获得的护盾值提升至120% + 5% HP。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","When actively used, increases the shield value to 120% + 5% HP."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，获得的护盾值提升至130% + 5% HP。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","When actively used, increases the shield value to 130% + 5% HP."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，获得的护盾值提升至140% + 5% HP。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","When actively used, increases the shield value to 140% + 5% HP."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","重压飞锤"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Flail Slam"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标造成多次伤害并击倒目标和其周围的敌人。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Callan deals damage multiple times to a target enemy, knocking the target and nearby enemies down."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","挥动流星锤对目标造成2次160% ATK伤害，随后重锤地面，对前方矩形范围内的敌人造成150% + 20% ATK伤害并击倒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Callan swings his flail to deal 160% ATK damage to an enemy twice. He then slams them on the ground, dealing 150% + 20% ATK damage to all enemies in a rectangular area in front of him and knocking them down."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":47,"end":53,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":113,"end":119,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":43,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":32,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":109,"end":123,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","最后一击造成的伤害提升至170% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases slam damage to 170% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","最后一击造成的伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases slam damage to 200% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","最后一击造成的伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases slam damage to 220% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","不朽护葬"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Eternal Watch"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","将护盾所抵御的伤害积蓄为自身力量，积蓄达到一定值时，主动释放造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Callan converts the damage absorbed by his shield into golem's might. When the stored golem's might reaches a threshold, he unleashes it to deal AoE damage."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在战斗过程中，将自身护盾抵御的伤害值的25% + 1%积蓄为力量，主动使用时，将这个力量释放，对周围2格范围内的敌人造成等量的伤害。当积蓄的力量超过350% ATK时才会使用本技能，单次至多释放600% ATK力量，超过的部分将被保留至下一次释放。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Callan converts 25% + 1% of the damage absorbed by his shield into golem's might during battle.\nActive. Callan unleashes the stored golem's might to deal an equal amount damage to enemies within a 2-tile radius. This skill can only be used when the amount of stored golem's might exceeds 350% ATK. Each cast consumes up to 600% ATK of the stored might, with any excess reserved for the next cast."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":97,"end":105,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":288,"end":296,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":323,"end":331,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","将自身护盾抵御的伤害值的28% + 1%积蓄为力量。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Callan converts 28% + 1% of the damage absorbed by his shield into golem's might."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","将自身护盾抵御的伤害值的31% + 1%积蓄为力量。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Callan converts 31% + 1% of the damage absorbed by his shield into golem's might."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","将自身护盾抵御的伤害值的35% + 1%积蓄为力量。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Callan converts 35% + 1% of the damage absorbed by his shield into golem's might."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身受愈。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Vitality during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受愈提升11点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Vitality by 11 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受愈提升15点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Vitality by 15 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受愈提升19点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Vitality by 19 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","怨怒暝眩"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Hollowed Wrath"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","每场战斗一次，当自身或友军生命值较低时，对周围敌人造成大量伤害和眩晕。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","When Callan or an ally's HP drops low, he unleashes a devastating attack, dealing massive damage to nearby enemies and stunning them. This skill can be used once per battle."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗仅释放一次，当自身或场上任意一名非召唤物友军的生命值低于30%时释放一次怒吼，对全体敌人造成8次50% ATK伤害和0.5秒眩晕。释放期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When Callan or any non-summoned ally's HP falls below 30%, he lets out a wrathful howl, dealing 50% ATK damage per enemy to all enemies up to 8 times and stunning them for 0.5s. While casting this skill, Callan becomes unaffected. This skill can be used once per battle."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":75,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":96,"end":103,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":219,"end":229,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至60% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 60% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","眩晕时长提升至2秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases stun duration to 2s."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 70% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","获得护盾时可以回复一定量生命值。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Callan recovers a certain amount of HP when gaining a shield."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","获得任意护盾时，立即回复等同于护盾最大值15%的生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When gaining a shield, Callan recovers HP equal to 15% of the shield's max value."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时获得的护盾提升至600% HP，为周围2格范围友军承担的伤害比例提升至80%。并且自身从该状态中结束后起身的速度加快50%。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Callan enhances the shield granted by Restless Guardian at the start of battle, increasing its value to 600% HP and raising the percentage of incoming damage it absorbs to 80% for allies within 2 tiles. After the shield expires, he gets back up 50% faster."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":104,"end":111,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","封墓连枷"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Tombflail"]]}